<p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">We have received notice from the credit card processor that you have disputed the charge related to the attached invoice. We will be refuting this chargeback based upon the terms of your contract with Insperity (attached); therefore, if you feel you have been billed in error, please contact us as soon as possible to resolve.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

